{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396740/extras/AboutGame-.gif?t=1744975587\" /><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the eerie, endless corridors of the Backrooms in this intense multiplayer horror experience. With online co-op support for up to 7 players, you and your friends must survive the unsettling labyrinth, solve mysterious puzzles, and evade unspeakable horrors lurking in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396740/extras/Steam1.gif?t=1744975587\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Realistic Graphics &amp; Environments:</strong> Immerse yourself in the Backrooms with stunning visuals and atmospheric detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Human Eye Focus Mechanic:</strong> A unique camera system mimics human eye focus \u2014 objects you're looking at become crystal clear, enhancing immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In-Game Pranks:</strong> Slap your friends or perform funny actions to lighten the tension \u2014 if only for a moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Survival:</strong> Split up or stick together \u2014 teamwork and communication are your lifelines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere:</strong> Dynamic lighting and detailed environments plunge you into forgotten rooms and impossible spaces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terrifying Enemies:</strong> Each monster has distinct behaviors and hunts you relentlessly. Stay quiet, hide, and trust your instincts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5 Challenging Levels:</strong> From claustrophobic halls to vast eerie areas, every level offers new horrors. Expect regular updates and new levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Co-op Puzzles &amp; Escape Mechanics:</strong> Find keys, solve riddles, unlock exits \u2014 but danger lurks at every turn.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Do You Have What It Takes?<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396740/extras/Steam3.gif?t=1744975587\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival demands strategy, stealth, and nerves of steel. Stay close to your team\u00a0 or risk being lost forever. The Backrooms don't care how many survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready. Escape is possible but only together.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396740/extras/Steam2.gif?t=1744975587\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396740?t=1744975587","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396740?t=1744975587","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396740/62c2fe9a1f2c45e3a8bba11ba35fd728cac83f22/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744975587","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396740/62c2fe9a1f2c45e3a8bba11ba35fd728cac83f22/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744975587","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3522630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396740/extras/Release.png?t=1744975587\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396740/extras/AboutGame-.gif?t=17